        {
          "text": " Itakanete ebe iraas yesi ebalua loka Kristo, lokijaanakini isio, iwadikatai mere kebuino dimarai kEmoyo loka Edeke lokajaran, mere amor, dimarai otauon luka awat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
