        {
          "text": " Aso arai aijaanakin naka atwanare naigirigiritai kinyukutan kamoru, abu kobu kaibuses, tetere mam idwe luka Isirael apedorete asesen akonyen nuka Musa kanuka aibuses naka akonyeneke, aibuses ŋin naitapalaunio, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
